OL,3,GNEWSA#2.2m of payouts for force's
OL,4,Ainjured officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA county's police force has spent #2.2m
OL,7,Fon payouts after more than 100 officers
OL,8,Fwere injured on duty last year.
OL,10,FNorfolk Police paid out to 139 officers
OL,11,Fwho suffered physical or psychological
OL,12,Fharm while at work, the Local Democracy
OL,13,FReporting Service (LDRS) said.
OL,15,FLast year one in nine officers were
OL,16,Fsigned off on mental health grounds -
OL,17,Fmore than double that in 2016 and the
OL,18,Fnumber of assaults on officers in the
OL,19,Fcounty rose from 600 in 2019/20 to 840
OL,20,Fcases.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
