OL,3,GNEWSA#2.2m of payouts for force's
OL,4,Ainjured officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesman for Norfolk Constabulary
OL,7,Fsaid the force regularly reviewed
OL,8,Fsafety measures and was working to
OL,9,Fimprove training and equipment.
